{1}{Oh my!  Who let "you" in here?}{Oh my!  Who let "you" in here?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{A technologist!  Truly you are in the wrong place sir!}{A technologist!  Truly you are in the wrong place madam!}{}{}{}{ }
{3}{Greetings si..  Uh...  er...  A technologist?  Here!?!  Goodness!}{Greetings mad..  Uh...  er...  A technologist?  Here!?!  Goodness!}{}{}{}{ }
{4}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{5}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{6}{I have nothing to say to you, technologist!}{I have nothing to say to you, technologist!}{}{}{}{ }
{7}{Please remove your tainted aura from my presence!}{Please remove your tainted aura from my presence!}{}{}{}{ }
{8}{I cannot surmise why the Masters would allow someone of your ilk to roam Tulla freely!}{I cannot surmise why the Masters would allow someone of your ilk to roam Tulla freely!}{}{}{}{ }
{9}{Really!  What can the Masters be thinking?  Allowing the filth of technology to enter the splendor of Tulla!}{Really!  What can the Masters be thinking?  Allowing the filth of technology to enter the splendor of Tulla!}{}{}{}{ }
{10}{Be gone blasphemer!  You are disrupting the magickal flow necessary for my studies!}{Be gone blasphemer!  You are disrupting the magickal flow necessary for my studies!}{}{}{}{ }
{11}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{12}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
