{15}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{16}{Welcome mage.  I give you greeting.}{Welcome mage.  I give you greeting.}{}{}{}{ }
{17}{Greetings wise one.  No doubt you have come to Tulla to improve upon your skills.}{Greetings wise one.  No doubt you have come to Tulla to improve upon your skills.}{}{}{}{ }
{18}{Welcome outlander!  ...ah, I sense strong magick in you.  I am sure you will find Tulla most enlightening.}{Welcome outlander!  ...ah, I sense strong magick in you.  I am sure you will find Tulla most enlightening.}{}{}{}{ }
{19}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{20}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{If you have not, you must meet with the Masters!  Their knowledge will truly astound you.}{If you have not, you must meet with the Masters!  Their knowledge will truly astound you.}{}{}{}{ }
{22}{Such power...  I am humbled by your presence.}{Such power...  I am humbled by your presence.}{}{}{}{ }
{23}{Tulla is truly a mage's delight, is it not?}{Tulla is truly a mage's delight, is it not?}{}{}{}{ }
{24}{The very ground emanates with the tremendous magickal power of Tulla.  Can you sense it, mage?}{The very ground emanates with the tremendous magickal power of Tulla.  Can you sense it, mage?}{}{}{}{ }
{25}{You should seek the Masters.  I am sure they would be impressed with your power, outlander.}{You should seek the Masters.  I am sure they would be impressed with your power, outlander.}{}{}{}{ }
{26}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{27}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
