{31}{Greetings, stranger.  You're countenance shines brightly from your pure heart.}{Greetings, stranger.  You're countenance shines brightly from your pure heart.}{}{}{}{ }
{32}{Welcome.  We are honoured to have the pure of heart visit us here in Tulla.}{Welcome.  We are honoured to have the pure of heart visit us here in Tulla.}{}{}{}{ }
{33}{Ah...  A truly noble creature stands before me.  I bid you welcome, outlander.}{Ah...  A truly noble creature stands before me.  I bid you welcome, outlander.}{}{}{}{ }
{34}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{35}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{36}{It is rare to see goodness such as yours, sir.}{It is rare to see goodness such as yours, madam.}{}{}{}{ }
{37}{I am honoured to be in the presence of such purity.}{I am honoured to be in the presence of such purity.}{}{}{}{ }
{38}{Have you met the Masters as of yet?  I suspect they would be very happy to meet such a noble gentleman.}{Have you met the Masters as of yet?  I suspect they would be very happy to meet such a noble lady.}{}{}{}{ }
{39}{The great magicks that surround Tulla cause your virtue to shine even brighter, stranger.}{The great magicks that surround Tulla cause your virtue to shine even brighter, stranger.}{}{}{}{ }
{40}{The brightness of your spirit is a breath of fresh air, stranger.  I hope that Tulla is providing a welcome respite from your travels.}{The brightness of your spirit is a breath of fresh air, stranger.  I hope that Tulla is providing a welcome respite from your travels.}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{42}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
