{46}{Greetings, dark one.}{Greetings, dark one.}{}{}{}{ }
{47}{Oh my!  You would do well to study the ways of righteousness, stranger.}{Oh my!  You would do well to study the ways of righteousness, stranger.}{}{}{}{ }
{48}{Ah...  I sense your evils, outlander.  No doubt you have come seeking some of Tulla's darker secrets.}{Ah...  I sense your evils, outlander.  No doubt you have come seeking some of Tulla's darker secrets.}{}{}{}{ }
{49}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{50}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{It is rare to see darkness such as yours.  I pray you find what you came for quickly, stranger.}{It is rare to see darkness such as yours.  I pray you find what you came for quickly, stranger.}{}{}{}{ }
{52}{Uh... please sir.  I must return to my studies...}{Uh... please madam.  I must return to my studies...}{}{}{}{ }
{53}{The blackness upon your soul permeates your entire being.}{The blackness upon your soul permeates your entire being.}{}{}{}{ }
{54}{Be warned outlander...  The Guardians frown upon evil doings within the walls of Tulla.}{Be warned outlander...  The Guardians frown upon evil doings within the walls of Tulla.}{}{}{}{ }
{55}{I have no quarrel with you stranger.  Please allow me to continue my studies.}{I have no quarrel with you stranger.  Please allow me to continue my studies.}{}{}{}{ }
