{61}{Welcome, outlander.  May you enjoy your time here within the walls of Tulla.}{Welcome, outlander.  May you enjoy your time here within the walls of Tulla.}{}{}{}{ }
{62}{It is good to see new faces about.  Good day to you, stranger.}{It is good to see new faces about.  Good day to you, stranger.}{}{}{}{ }
{63}{Oh!  It is not often we have visitors!  Greetings, outlander.}{Oh!  It is not often we have visitors!  Greetings, outlander.}{}{}{}{ }
{64}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{65}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{66}{I am trying to concentrate.  Please do not disturb me!}{I am trying to concentrate.  Please do not disturb me!}{}{}{}{ }
{67}{You are finding Tulla to be a true marvel, no doubt.}{You are finding Tulla to be a true marvel, no doubt.}{}{}{}{ }
{68}{Look about.  Enjoy the beauty of Tulla and stand in awe of her power.}{Look about.  Enjoy the beauty of Tulla and stand in awe of her power.}{}{}{}{ }
{69}{Have you met the Masters yet?  Truly you will find no greater power in all of Arcanum than that which they possess.}{Have you met the Masters yet?  Truly you will find no greater power in all of Arcanum than that which they possess.}{}{}{}{ }
{70}{Can you feel the thickness of the magick in the air?  It is most invigorating!}{Can you feel the thickness of the magick in the air?  It is most invigorating!}{}{}{}{ }
