{76}{Good day to you, Master.}{Good day to you, Master.}{}{}{}{ }
{77}{A Master!  I am at your service, sir.}{A Master!  I am at your service, madam.}{}{}{}{ }
{78}{A new Master!  Most impressive!  I offer my congratulations!}{A new Master!  Most impressive!  I offer my congratulations!}{}{}{}{ }
{79}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{80}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{81}{I am honoured by your attention, great Master.}{I am honoured by your attention, great Master.}{}{}{}{ }
{82}{I hope to one day become a Master Mage, like yourself, sir.}{I hope to one day become a Master Mage, like yourself, madam.}{}{}{}{ }
{83}{I stand humbled before your powers, great Master.}{I stand humbled before your powers, great Master.}{}{}{}{ }
{84}{Truly Mastery must have come easy to one such as yourself.}{Truly Mastery must have come easy to one such as yourself.}{}{}{}{ }
{85}{Perhaps one day you will choose to give a lecture in our great hall, Master.  I am certain you could teach us much.}{Perhaps one day you will choose to give a lecture in our great hall, Master.  I am certain you could teach us much.}{}{}{}{ }

